    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sagadiyusmoó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kudá' ta bay Mose iwa gwaá', AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Yoshua garmoó Nuni alee/iisusmoó Mose, guri báy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Sagadiyusmooeé' Mose aa gwaá'. Gím daxta tláw, kuúng nee múk Israeli sleémeero, yaaér Yordani waarahhaak, ta datá' baraá yaamuudá' aníng ni haniis dír xoorór Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuúqo dír ya'aahúng ni adahiia nga kuungá' i haniís, adoodá' aníng ngira al'axweés dír Mose i alé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Digeemihúng bihhaá basko a iimír xaanxaywí wa tleemu bihhaá /iiko ay tlom'aá Lebanoni, bihhaá da/aawe ay yaaeedá' ur ar Eufrate, yaamaá múk Hiti sleémeero, bihhaá /uwaawo harki/isayhúng ay Tlawtá Tla/aangw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hee tumu wák i kaahh oo kuúng u tlampa'aás baraá deelór hotaawók sleémeero. Aníng nee kuúng a dinkwa, adoodá' aníng nee Mose tara dinku'uusaán daqisleém, kuúng gár uwa /aaruw i káhh, nee u geexawaaká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gimáy piíhh nee ilakaahareés ló' wa alé, asma kuúng mukwí un dahás baraá yaamuudá' aníng naa lo'ór wa /aáy ngiwa haniis dír baabi'ii'ín i alé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gimáy piíhh nee ilakaahareés ló'wa ale, nee dabe sleémeero na boo/eeseek adoodá' sagadiyusmooeé' Mose ngira kuúngí hara'ayín. Ma warqawaar laqaá ma bihhií paslaar, daqaní arba/ati a sleér amór taqo keera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitaábuuwí oo dabe umuú qoomaaro soomuuseek. Nee intsaatsahheek tlatla/aangw nee xweeraawo, ala gár taaqo gooini baraá kitaábuuwí ale boo/eeseek. Daqaní kuúng amohhooa a sleér nee diihhooa baraá hotangoge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inslawiím adór aníng kuúng ura báw, gimáy piíhh nee ilakaahareés ló' wa ale. Ma da'ayumiitaar laqaá ma amoqwaqwadimaar, asma anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Munguúwók a dinkwa nee kuúng amór taqo keera.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Yoshua, geeraharuuse gari báy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Tlawsé' waaraahhé' ar dír umuú xafto, nee muksíng ku beera', ‹Muruú /ayma amohhe'eesaak, asma alaá deelo tame yaaér Yordani a waarahhaán tawa data' baraá yaamuudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Munguúhúng ni kuungií haniisi, as kiwa ala'.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluudae Yoshua tlahhoó Reubeni nee oo Gadi, nee tlaqtá tlahhoó Manase, giri báy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kuungá' axweesanoó Mose sagadiyusmoó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nuwa hara'ayín inslawaak, kudá' nuwa báy, ‹AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng dír ti hungu/usa' ngi haniis, nee yaamuuká' ngi kuungií haniis.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlaawayhúng nee na/iihúng nee hikwahunge ni meetiye' baraá ayaawí Mose naa kuungá' i haniís, amór gayuwí oo yaaér Yordani. Ala hhawaataá miguuse awa xoslaá slaqwarár koomá' ta geeraá hhaeeín wa giirin nee kiwa alee/iisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alee/iisaak ay dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ yaamaá hhaeehúng tay hungu/uusi ngay haniisi, adór koohúng ngira haniís, inooín sleeme yaamaá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng, aa haniís kin aal, daqaní kuungá' tari ki/á' amór yaamuuhúng kudá' tinda haniís nee Mose sagadiyusmoó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kudá' bihhaá da/ií diriiá' yaaér Yordaniro as kiwa ala'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua kuri báy, «Muruuwí sleémeero naa atén beér u tleehhaán, nee umuúqo amór kuúng ti ya/aba atén a daqawán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoodá' atén Mose kura iialooeesaán an adoodá' kuúng sleeme ur iiaalooeesaan. Nee AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúwók masók a dinkwa nee kuúng, adoodá' ira dinku'uús nee Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heé hara'ayarók gaa aahh, nee oo axweesantók ga iialooeemisaaká, laqaá umuúqo gár kwaa beeri ga axamiisaaká a gaasa. Gimáy muuna hhe'eés nee migís.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
